  "title": "EA Test 1 — flooding a disconnected water body",
  "description": "700 m × 100 m sloping strip with a depression behind a 10.25 m sill. A water-level boundary rises from 9.7 m to 10.35 m, holds, then falls back; the pond must fill, become horizontal, and settle at the sill crest. Tests wetting/drying and disconnected water bodies.",
